WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:08.208
Famagan e Gwiriko Ɗuum ko haala taariika, ɗum laaɓɓi ngam hollaago.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:15.624
Nder karnuwol sappo e joweetati, Kong laati gariiri kuuɓal mawɗo, nden boo nder konu.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:32.480
O'attara mo anndiraaɗo woni ardiiɗo konu.

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:43.888
O torraaɓe ɓe ngaɗata ko'e maɓɓe, ɓe ndaari, ɓe mbaɗi bee kaafahi.

00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:09.794
Wakkati go'o, o yahdi bee jama'aare maako haa woyla hirnaange. Wonaa laawol gootol.

00:01:14.000 --> 00:01:17.536
Ɓe ɗon yaha nder ladde e nder maayo, ɓe ɗon ndilli.

00:01:33.000 --> 00:01:37.138
Ɗeen ngoni nder fannu Bobo. Ɗoon, leydi ndii ina jogii joomumɓe.

00:01:43.500 --> 00:01:46.172
Mi wari mi salmini ma, mawɗo leydi ndii.

00:01:46.500 --> 00:01:48.980
On ɗon wari bana boowo, malla bana mawɗo?

00:01:49.500 --> 00:01:51.212
O laati alkawal.

00:01:54.000 --> 00:01:59.354
Allah hokki yimɓe maako barkiɗinki nder lesdi. O waɗi alkawal.

00:02:11.000 --> 00:02:17.106
Ammaa naa yimɓe fuu njaɓaayi. Mawɗo mooliijo ɗon jeyaa e juuɗe.

00:02:19.000 --> 00:02:21.512
Ko'e mon, ko'e mooɗon e ɓerɗe mon fuu.

00:02:31.000 --> 00:02:32.312
Mi hokkata.

00:02:34.000 --> 00:02:40.490
Hakkilantooɓe ɓe'e ɗon dari juuɗe muuɗum'en. Walaa koo moye ɗon haɓɓa bee Famagan.

00:02:55.000 --> 00:02:58.050
Laamu jibini dow Bobo: Gwiriko.

00:03:01.000 --> 00:03:06.530
O wi'i: "Luttuɓe nder lesdi ɗon ngi'a jam, laawol maɓɓe ɗon laaɓina.

00:03:10.000 --> 00:03:14.778
Famagan ɗon anndina. Luttuɗo leydi ndii ina fuɗɗii ɓeydaade.

00:03:31.000 --> 00:03:35.970
Fuude mawnde ɗon ɓeyda: kola, limce e njamndi ɗon yahra bee juuɗe.

00:04:02.000 --> 00:04:06.080
Haa hande, Ouattara'en nder Bobo-Dioulasso ɗon siftora haala nden.
